# "{T}, Sacrifice Lotus Petal: Add one mana of any color" (CR 605.1a, 106.1b): each Petal gives one mana of the color its
# controller names, so a blue one and a black one pay {U}{B} for Baleful Strix on turn 1, and both are sacrificed as the
# cost of their mana abilities, leaving them in the graveyard. Baleful Strix draws a card on entering.

[Bot1 Deck]
Lotus Petal
Lotus Petal
Baleful Strix
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Black)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{B}
Bot1.Hand.Baleful Strix.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lotus Petal; Lotus Petal
Bot1.Battlefield = Baleful Strix
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
